#. Description of the plugin
#: email-log-notifications.php
msgid "A companion to your SMTP plugin: sends the email notifications (inquiry notifications to the sales inbox, auto-confirmations back to the visitor in their own language) and keeps a log of every send with its delivery result."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
